ce for the voiceless um  why why are you you don't have to you  don't have why  i feel indebted  and i feel i mean these are people i  i've been in this community for about 20  years now  whether it be  uso shows or or the warrior games which  is an adaptive rehabilitative like  olympic type event uh achilles heel  freedom team i've gotten to know this  community very well i've gotten to know  their stories very well i've gotten to  know the undue burden that this country  places on military families it's a very  small percentage of the country we ask  them to sacrifice a great deal their  housing is often in shambles we've got  military veterans active duty on food  stamps within 830 billion dollar defense  budget  unconscionable  and i look at it as  as a bellwether  these are the people that we purport to  uphold as the best of us  and we can't even do right by them  so what chance do the rest of us have  for any kind of equity for any kind of  of fairness if they can't get health  care if they go bankrupt  from their cancers that were caused by  their service  what the hell are the rest of us  supposed to do  john  thank you so much for joining us and  thank you for your passion in your fight  right now thank you

